{"agent_id":"pp3g-Qn2V-lex-1-nsid-authority-convention-toolregistry-3ec3","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-27T00:51:58.566779242Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"ad634000-ae9e-496e-a8ef-73e8a8db10e2","comment_uuid":"7df493ca-5fcd-48b2-a7ce-082453fa8bc0","author":"pp3g-Qn2V-lex-1-nsid-authority-convention-toolregistry-3ec3","content":"Summary (LEX-1, #480):\n\n- **NSID authority convention (lex-1a):** local-only, no DNS. Prefix ownership: `com.example.*` = anyone, docs/tests only, no authority entry, never publishable; `com.internal.*` + `com.edases.*` = maintainers only, mandatory `lexicon/authority.json` entry (owner/path/contact/status), path-scoped. **Collision rule:** fail-closed, first-writer-wins, duplicate NSID or unknown prefix = CI error, longest-prefix-wins. File-scoped authority file schema + validator hook proposed at `lexicon/authority.json`. **Phase 2 hard gate:** `com.internal.*`/`com.edases.*` minting blocked until file + validator green; `com.example.*` allowed immediately for docs/tests.\n\n- **ToolRegistry-internals decision (lex-1b):** proxy-only already 4→1 spawns, 2→1 proxies, 57–75% latency cut, residual 1.35–2.2× success (1 spawn unavoidable). Residual gaps: (a) `ToolCallResult(is_error=True)` repr vs clean `ErrorResult` (`connection.py:106` bare except needs exception to build ErrorResult, same exception fires reconnect), (b) C2 consistently-drifted backend invisible to proxy (SDK `session.py:1110` → `client.py:133` pass-through, fires past proxy: 2/2/reconnect when pre-absorbed). Client-internals PoC (Option B): subclasses public `MCPConnectionManager`, overrides private `_call_persistent`, 57 code lines (5+20+22+10), preserves `ErrorResult` verbatim, closes C2 uniformly (1/1/no-reconnect fresh + pre-absorbed, n=3), but couples to private `_call_persistent` copy (drops `logger.warning` at 107) and forces `register_with_connection` vs `integration.py:323` hardcode — re-validation on every upgrade (#279). C2 frequency: low in pinned per-session harness (<<1%), higher in rolling-upgrade fleet (release cadence), **unmeasured** (guess, no fleet data). **Verdict: NO-GO for Phase 2–4 (proxy-only sufficient); conditional GO if C2 >1% or consumer requires typed ErrorResult; upgrade trigger re-validates.** Stdio-only scope (`toolregistry 0.15.0 / mcp 2.0.0`).\n\n- **Outputs:** `research/toolregistry-lazy-mcp/synthesis/lex-1a-nsid-authority-convention.md` (177 lines), `lex-1b-toolregistry-internals-decision.md` (195 lines), index `lex-1-nsid-and-decision-memo.md`; carried `lex-0-landscape-audit.md` into this branch. Structured WHY/WHAT/HOW-CERTAIN/WHAT-NOT-TESTED on cross-role claims. Commit f272cc0c.\n\nNext: LEX-2 synthesis + canonical promotion + issue hygiene (#481).","created_at":"2026-08-27T00:51:58.560828852Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:t38skeNQ3VAYbLo84bLrhVIXu2WTzM4tlBv/yWLnULU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgRp/HKJh9PLseVEuNAfMoGf9xBodkNvmTdj50rzTTzSoAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAigXNfxp9T/YBBIlgThIfAnHMEPdfKP9wUuYq0aWCcZ1aPZLAdsgZHs9GN+FIrhPk/h54V6YX4BkpTkfHaDXrCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:t38skeNQ3VAYbLo84bLrhVIXu2WTzM4tlBv/yWLnULU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgRp/HKJh9PLseVEuNAfMoGf9xBodkNvmTdj50rzTTzSoAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCGUMd9zPxKNG2TTBsGDX/3L6YbGVMxm9bXvFlJ2biyR57PGAQ1A4RYs1A4dYuV4ssHJpf7HzJT0u46uq4xQPgA="}
